|| '/' enna? "Illana" nu artham. Table-la illaadha name vandha (e.g., typo 'outt'), PAGE_PATHS['outt'] → undefined. Appo undefined || '/' → '/', so Home-ku pogum. App crash aagaama irukka oru safety net 🥅

