🧠 Concept: Controlled Input

HTML-la <input> value-ah browser vechirukkum. React-la, value-ah useState vechukkanum. Idhukku per "Controlled Input" 🎮

Type "T"  →  onChange  →  setVehicleNumber("T")  →  re-render  →  input shows "T"

Rendu important props:

┌───────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         Prop          │                      Velai                       │
├───────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ value={vehicleNumber} │ Input-la enna show aaganum → state-la irundhu 📥 │
├───────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ onChange={...}        │ Type pannumbodhu state-ah update pannu 📤        │
└───────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

e.target.value = input-la ippo type panna full text
- e = event (what happened)
- e.target = andha input box
- .value = adhula irukkura text



______________________________________________________________

onnume theriyala after - ▎ onChange line-ah delete panni type pannuna enna aagudhu?

Correct! 🎯 Adhu dhaan answer. Type pannalum input-la onnume varaadhu, box freeze aagidum 🧊 Nalla observe panneenga 👏

🔐 Yen apdi aagudhu? Controlled Input-oda secret

value={vehicleNumber} pottaa, React solludhu:

▎ "Indha box-la eppovum vehicleNumber state-la irukkuradhu mattum dhaan show aaganum. Vera edhuvum illa!"

onChange irundha ✅

1. "T" type pannureenga ⌨️
2. onChange → setVehicleNumber("T")   📤 state update
3. React re-render
4. value={vehicleNumber} → "T"         📥 box-la "T" show

onChange illana ❌

1. "T" type pannureenga ⌨️
2. ... yaarum state-ah update pannala 🤷
3. vehicleNumber innum "" (empty)
4. value={""} → React box-ah thirumba EMPTY-ah maathudhu 🧊
Browser "T" add panna try pannudhu, React udane adha azhichudhu. Adhanaala freeze!

🎮 Analogy

- value = TV screen 📺: remote (state) enna solludho adha mattum dhaan kaattum
- onChange = remote-la button press panradhu 🎛️

Remote button illana, TV-ah evlo thatti paathaalum channel maaraadhu 😄

